          "key": "blocked",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "raising max_concurrent_requests above 16 is blocked: requests queue at the cap and the highest sampled KV-cache usage is 67%, too high for a larger cap to fit; see `more-kv-memory` under Could help",
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "audience": "all",
          "item": false,
          "key": "could_help",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Could help:",
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "audience": "all",
          "basis": "",
          "command": "tensward analyse --project /p/lb --engine-arg max-num-seqs=16 --engine-arg gpu-memory-utilization=0.95",
          "costs": "less memory headroom: the engine may fail to start",
          "evidence": "strong",
          "key": "more-kv-memory",
          "kind": "suggestion",
          "name": "more-kv-memory",
          "near": false,
          "quality_risk": false,
          "reason": "raising max_concurrent_requests above 16 is blocked: requests queue at the cap and the highest sampled KV-cache usage is 67%, too high for a larger cap to fit; kv_memory_fraction is the engine default. Raising it to 0.95 gives the engine more of the GPU's memory for the KV cache, which may not be enough to raise the cap, and leaves the GPU less memory headroom, so the engine may fail to start or run out of memory",
          "tier": "could_help"
        },
        {
          "audience": "all",
          "basis": "your prompts",
          "command": "tensward analyse --project /p/lb --engine-arg max-num-seqs=16 --engine-arg 'speculative-config={\"method\": \"ngram\", \"num_speculative_tokens\": 4, \"prompt_lookup_max\": 4}'",
          "costs": "TPOT rises when answers do not copy the prompt, and at high concurrency; a slower start",
          "evidence": "moderate",
          "key": "ngram-speculation",
          "kind": "suggestion",
          "name": "ngram-speculation",
          "near": false,
          "quality_risk": false,
          "reason": "prompts are long (median 1523 words beyond what they share). N-gram speculation drafts tokens by copying spans of the prompt, so it only helps when answers quote or repeat their input; otherwise it costs a little - compare TPOT with and without it",
          "tier": "could_help"
        },
        {
          "audience": "all",
          "basis": "",
          "command": "tensward analyse --project /p/lb --engine-arg max-num-seqs=16 --engine-arg max-num-batched-tokens=4096",
          "costs": "TPOT p95 rises as larger chunks stall running decodes",
          "evidence": "moderate",
          "key": "raise-prefill-batch",
          "kind": "suggestion",
          "name": "raise-prefill-batch",
          "near": true,
          "quality_risk": false,
          "reason": "prompt work takes 80% of engine time with requests waiting, but steps are not full; a larger budget lets more prompt tokens into each step and can stall running decodes (TPOT p95) - measure TTFT and TPOT p95",
          "tier": "could_help"
        },
